SUMMARY:QHHT session with Shaman Phil
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**This is a single person event for an in
 -person quantum healing session near Nebo\, NC.**\n\n**If you are interest
 ed in visiting a past-life and getting in touch with your higher self\, pl
 ease join me for this infornative and very intense opportunity. The sessio
 n is based on Dolores Cannon’s Quantum Healing Hypnosis Technique and ta
 kes about three hours to complete.**\n\n**We have human friendly cats. I c
 an also arrange to come to your place (or neutral location) for an additio
 nal fee.**\n\n**There are some small activities that should be accomplishe
 d prior to the meeting\, for a more quality session\, so I will be request
 ing an email address to send instructions to.**\n\n**It is important to le
 t me know prior to the session if you cannot make it to allow someone else
  to take your space.**\n\n**See you soon!**\n**Shaman Phil**
