SUMMARY:Sun Circle: Libra Season
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nWhen the sun moves into a new sign an ene
 rgetic shift occurs. Learning to connect\, listen\, and set intentions wit
 h the sun is a beautiful way to add ritual into your life.\nLibra season i
 s from 9/22 - 10/23 and for this gathering we'll discuss the Astrological 
 happenings of the zodiac season and where it will impact you personally (b
 irth chart recommended not required).\nAs with all energetic shifts\, gett
 ing into your body is important. Together we'll ground into the energy thr
 ough meditation and somatic movement themed around the season.\nAccommodat
 ions/Modification will be made for ALL bodies\, come as you are.\nWe'll cl
 ose out with time for journaling and optional sharing.\n\n***Bring:***\n\n
 Comfortable clothes to move in\nJournal and pen\nBirth chart if you have i
 t\nwater bottle\n\nDonation Based Event
