SUMMARY:Autumn Equinox Cacao: A Candlelight Affair with Mars & Venus
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nAutumnal Equinox Cacao: A Candlelight Aff
 air with Mars & Venus\n**Balancing the Cosmic Within**\n**Tuesday\, Septem
 ber 22nd 6:33-8:33PM**\nJoin David & Michelle at Quietude on September 22n
 d as day and night kiss in equal measure\, holding the world in a breathta
 king\, breathless pause. At 8:04 PM (Exact Equinox) the solar fire masculi
 ne season of active growth\, heat\, and outward light slowly surrenders it
 s crown to the lunar depth of the feminine energy\, ushering in reflection
 \, intuition\, and the quiet return to the earth. In this cosmic alignment
 \, action finds its stillness\, and giving meets receiving. All outer plan
 ets and Chiron will be in retrograde ushering Venus into her shadow phase 
 before she goes retrograde for 40 days. This will serve as a prelude into 
 reflecting on our personal relationships and our own underworld journeys. 
 We will rest in a moment\, balancing our own inner fire and fluid grace in
  order to step into the quiet\, grounding rhythm of the harvest moon and t
 he darker half of the year.\nUnder the gentle glow of candlelight\, we wil
 l gather to contemplate the sacred romance within each of us. Together\, w
 e will journey through the astrology of Mars and Venus. Through the heart-
 opening magic of ceremonial cacao and the soothing vibrations of a mini so
 und activation\, we will bridge these two powerful forces\, bringing them 
 into a state of peaceful equilibrium within ourselves.\nWhat to Expect:\n\
 n* **Candlelit Sanctuary:** Gather in a softly illuminated\, cozy space de
 signed to soothe the nervous system and welcome the quiet energy of autumn
 .\n* **Ceremonial Cacao:** Sip warm\, pure\, heart-opening cacao to ground
  your energy\, heighten your awareness\, and unlock intuitive insights.\n*
  **Astrological Insights:** Explore how Mars and Venus manifest in your li
 fe\, and learn how to balance your external giving with your capacity to r
 eceive.\n* **Cosmic Alignment:** Guided reflection and intention-setting t
 o unite your internal masculine and feminine energies\, clearing the path 
 for harmony in the season ahead.\n* **Mini Sound Activation:** Immerse you
 rself in high-frequency sound waves designed to clear energetic blockages\
 , integrate the cacao\, and harmonize your internal polarities at the exac
 t moment of the equinox.\n* **Deep Integration:** A peaceful\, grounding c
 losing to anchor your intentions and transition smoothly into the reflecti
 ve half of the year.\n\n**🙏Donations Start at $33 up to $55 Please give
  what you can to guarantee your spot. You can Vemno @starsounds (last four
  6690)**\n**or credit card at** [Star Sounds](https://www.starsounds.love/
 event-details/autumn-equinox-cacao-a-candlelight-affair-with-mars-venus)\n
 **If $33 is to much\, just email David at [[david@starsounds.love](mailto:
 david@starsounds.love)]([mailto:david@starsounds.love](http://mailto:david
 @starsounds.love)) for a special price🙏**\nIf you prefer to make it spo
 ntaneous\, you are welcome to show up and we will fill remaining spots on 
 a first-come basis. See you there\n\n### **About Your Guides**\n\n**David 
 Heiss** is an Evolutionary Astrologer\, Sound Alchemist & Sacred Ceremony 
 Facilitator who specializes in Self-Discovery. He helps reveal each person
 ’s unique collection of stars and sound using a variety of insightful ch
 art readings\, sound journeys\, fire ceremonies\, and immersive experience
 s. David blends Gongs\, Crystal and Tibetan bowls\, plus many other mystic
 al instruments to cultivate conditions for healing and restoration. [https
 ://www.starsounds.love/](https://www.starsounds.love/)\n\n**Michelle** is 
 an avid SoulCollage® Creatrix and lifelong educator who knows we are a ne
 twork of connected humans. Michelle delights in nurturing and expanding id
 eas\, people\, and communities that are lighting up the world with their p
 recious energy. She works with individual’s HighSelves\, offering a wide
  range of tools and experiences\, to facilitate self-reflection and access
  to inner wisdom. Learn more [www.autumnhair.net](http://www.autumnhair.ne
 t).
